{"5013160":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hubble Bubble","steam_appid":5013160,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GHALYAN'S HOOKAH LOUNGE IS UNDER NEW MANAGEMENT!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op shopkeeper simulator for you and up to three friends. Your cargo pod just docked at a space station with empty pockets and a run-down hookah lounge to take over. Serve the customers, take their money and put it all back into the place, one upgrade at a time. The last owner left in a hurry. Nobody asked why.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/657088620c1dbacbc26429374b1a6542.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/657088620c1dbacbc26429374b1a6542.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/657088620c1dbacbc26429374b1a6542.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BOWL WON'T PACK ITSELF<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack the bowl, stretch the foil, poke the holes, heat the coals. Then do it all again, faster, because table six is getting angry. Brew coffee, pour tea, blend Nebulas, microwave burgers and get every order to the right alien before their patience runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/f46ff2295dd6b0bb3183186a99e9d2cf.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/f46ff2295dd6b0bb3183186a99e9d2cf.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/f46ff2295dd6b0bb3183186a99e9d2cf.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CUSTOMER IS ALWAYS HUNGRY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships drop off a steady stream of alien customers, and some pull up to the drive-thru without even landing. Keep them waiting and they storm out. Keep them happy and they tip. Most of them just want a smoke. Some of them want to eat the staff.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/5d16bad4693679bdb9baffd264ebc323.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/5d16bad4693679bdb9baffd264ebc323.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/5d16bad4693679bdb9baffd264ebc323.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMEBODY HAS TO WIPE TABLE SIX<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between orders, the lounge still needs you. Clear the tables as soon as customers leave. Carry hot coals to the hookahs without setting yourself on fire. Mop up after the customer who couldn't hold it in, and restock supplies before the shelves run dry. Split the jobs with your crew or run the whole shop solo.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0226010a604cc7269707c3592b441def.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0226010a604cc7269707c3592b441def.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0226010a604cc7269707c3592b441def.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM BARE WALLS TO THE COZIEST SPOT ON THE STATION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dollar goes back into your shop. Roll out carpets, hang paintings, install an aquarium, open the drive-thru, upgrade the lounge and take the elevator up to a second floor full of VIPs. Every upgrade shows up in the lounge and brings in more cash. Become the best shopkeepers in the galaxy, or at least the loudest. Money left over? Buy a G-String.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0c9831474c8c0bc1dbefb7af0cee0b26.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0c9831474c8c0bc1dbefb7af0cee0b26.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0c9831474c8c0bc1dbefb7af0cee0b26.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAVITY NOT INCLUDED<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything on this station runs on real physics, and that includes you. Stand in front of the wrong hatch and you get launched into space. Fall from too high and you hit the floor like a sack of potatoes. Every now and then the gravity generator cuts out, and hookahs, coals, customers and crewmates all lift off the floor. When it kicks back in, everything in the air lands at once. Thanks to proximity chat, everyone hears you panic before they see why.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/628f39b4bf1ea3b3714e8baf0605e367.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/628f39b4bf1ea3b3714e8baf0605e367.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/628f39b4bf1ea3b3714e8baf0605e367.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 1 to 4 players, or run the shop solo<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, serve, clean up, restock and grow your shop<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades you can actually see, from carpets to a second floor<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full hookah prep: tobacco, foil, coals, smoke<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee, tea, Nebulas, sodas, burgers and sandwiches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien customers with short patience and big mouths<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive-thru for spaceships<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill, Normal and Hard difficulty<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat (screaming included)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics everywhere, gravity sometimes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable outfits<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GHALYAN'S HOOKAH LOUNGE IS UNDER NEW MANAGEMENT!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op shopkeeper simulator for you and up to three friends. Your cargo pod just docked at a space station with empty pockets and a run-down hookah lounge to take over. Serve the customers, take their money and put it all back into the place, one upgrade at a time. The last owner left in a hurry. Nobody asked why.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/657088620c1dbacbc26429374b1a6542.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/657088620c1dbacbc26429374b1a6542.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/657088620c1dbacbc26429374b1a6542.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BOWL WON'T PACK ITSELF<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack the bowl, stretch the foil, poke the holes, heat the coals. Then do it all again, faster, because table six is getting angry. Brew coffee, pour tea, blend Nebulas, microwave burgers and get every order to the right alien before their patience runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/f46ff2295dd6b0bb3183186a99e9d2cf.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/f46ff2295dd6b0bb3183186a99e9d2cf.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/f46ff2295dd6b0bb3183186a99e9d2cf.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CUSTOMER IS ALWAYS HUNGRY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships drop off a steady stream of alien customers, and some pull up to the drive-thru without even landing. Keep them waiting and they storm out. Keep them happy and they tip. Most of them just want a smoke. Some of them want to eat the staff.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/5d16bad4693679bdb9baffd264ebc323.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/5d16bad4693679bdb9baffd264ebc323.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/5d16bad4693679bdb9baffd264ebc323.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMEBODY HAS TO WIPE TABLE SIX<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between orders, the lounge still needs you. Clear the tables as soon as customers leave. Carry hot coals to the hookahs without setting yourself on fire. Mop up after the customer who couldn't hold it in, and restock supplies before the shelves run dry. Split the jobs with your crew or run the whole shop solo.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0226010a604cc7269707c3592b441def.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0226010a604cc7269707c3592b441def.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0226010a604cc7269707c3592b441def.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM BARE WALLS TO THE COZIEST SPOT ON THE STATION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dollar goes back into your shop. Roll out carpets, hang paintings, install an aquarium, open the drive-thru, upgrade the lounge and take the elevator up to a second floor full of VIPs. Every upgrade shows up in the lounge and brings in more cash. Become the best shopkeepers in the galaxy, or at least the loudest. Money left over? Buy a G-String.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0c9831474c8c0bc1dbefb7af0cee0b26.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0c9831474c8c0bc1dbefb7af0cee0b26.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/0c9831474c8c0bc1dbefb7af0cee0b26.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GRAVITY NOT INCLUDED<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything on this station runs on real physics, and that includes you. Stand in front of the wrong hatch and you get launched into space. Fall from too high and you hit the floor like a sack of potatoes. Every now and then the gravity generator cuts out, and hookahs, coals, customers and crewmates all lift off the floor. When it kicks back in, everything in the air lands at once. Thanks to proximity chat, everyone hears you panic before they see why.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/628f39b4bf1ea3b3714e8baf0605e367.poster.avif?t=1793974859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/628f39b4bf1ea3b3714e8baf0605e367.webm?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/extras\/628f39b4bf1ea3b3714e8baf0605e367.mp4?t=1793974859\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 1 to 4 players, or run the shop solo<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, serve, clean up, restock and grow your shop<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades you can actually see, from carpets to a second floor<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full hookah prep: tobacco, foil, coals, smoke<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee, tea, Nebulas, sodas, burgers and sandwiches<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien customers with short patience and big mouths<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive-thru for spaceships<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill, Normal and Hard difficulty<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat (screaming included)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics everywhere, gravity sometimes<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable outfits<\/p>","short_description":"Co-op shopkeeper simulator for 1 to 4 players. Run a hookah lounge on a space station: take orders, prep hookahs, brew coffee, pour tea and restock supplies. Every dollar goes back into the place, from bare walls to a two-floor lounge with a drive-thru. Physics everywhere, gravity sometimes.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Czech","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/0b9d8ae5607debc9304edf94f4a6dd5c8afefdba\/header.jpg?t=1793974859","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/0210b12921ce7504da34565b950664c033be494e\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793974859","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5013160\/0210b12921ce7504da34565b950664c033be494e\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793974859","website":"https:\/\/paritagames.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4590 \/ AMD FX-8350<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD RX 580 <br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> A headset with a microphone is recommended for in-game proximity voice chat.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-9600K \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong>