background\/app\/5013160?t=1793974859","background_raw":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/5013160?t=1793974859","content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Hubble Bubble is set in a hookah lounge, so preparing, serving and smoking hookah is part of the core gameplay. It is shown as a social ritual between friends, never glamorized and never treated as a reward.\r\n\r\nThe game is also a physics comedy. Characters get thrown around the room and knocked over, but it is all cartoon slapstick: no blood, no gore, no weapons.\r\n\r\nOnline co-op includes proximity voice chat, so interactions between players are not controlled by us and are not rated."},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"14","required_age":"14","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Drogas lícitas\nViolência fantasiosa"},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"12","required_age":"12","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol \/ Tabak\nFantasy-Gewalt"}}}}}